UID:pa-2026-early-last@civic-forecast.pages.dev
DTSTAMP:20261027T020342Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261028
SUMMARY:Last day to vote at the election office (Pennsylvania)
DESCRIPTION:Pennsylvania has no traditional early voting\, but you can req
 uest\, fill out\, and turn in a mail ballot in one visit to your county e
 lections office or another designated site. The window for applying close
 s 5 p.m. Tue\, Oct 27\, and when it opens depends on when your county has
  ballots ready.\nMore: https://www.pa.gov/services/vote/find-your-local-p
 olling-place\nFrom The Civic Forecast: https://civic-forecast.pages.dev
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.pa.gov/services/vote/find-your-local-polling-place
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Last day to vote at the election office (Pennsylvania)
TRIGGER:-PT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
