SUMMARY:Clocks fall back one hour
DESCRIPTION:Daylight saving time ends at 2 a.m. local time on Sunday\, so 
 clocks go back to 1 a.m. and you get an extra hour. Hawaii and most of Ar
 izona do not change their clocks.\nMore: https://www.nist.gov/pml/time-an
 d-frequency-division/popular-links/daylight-saving-time-dst\nFrom The Civ
 ic Forecast: https://civic-forecast.pages.dev
